{
	"info": {
		"name": "decidiq-governance-reporting",
		"description": "Regulator export + multilingual reconciliation — the two governance-reporting surfaces that commit 2bb71af7 RETARGETED (its word) onto the universal entities when the board-portal parallel entities were retired.\n\nThis collection replaces board-portal.postman_collection.json. That file drove 40 requests at /api/boards, /api/boards/{id}/members, /api/boards/{id}/meetings, /api/board-meetings/{id}/resolutions and /api/resolutions/{id}/*. None of those routes exist: `boards`, `resolutions`, `board-member` and `board-meeting` appear ZERO times in appinfo/routes.php, because 2bb71af7 deleted the board-CRUD controllers outright (board=governance-body, board-meeting=meeting, resolution=decision, board-member=Person+Membership). Every write there 404'd to an HTML error page, so `pm.response.json()` threw and the whole file cascaded — it was the single largest block of Newman failures in the repo.\n\nThe 32 requests that exercised the DELETED parallel CRUD are gone: they asserted on endpoints the app deliberately no longer has, and the equivalent behaviour is covered against the universal entities by decidiq.postman_collection.json and its siblings. The 8 requests that exercised RETARGETED, still-live routes are preserved here verbatim — same methods, same bodies, same assertions — with one change: `boardId` is now seeded from a real `governance-body` object instead of a retired `board`. RegulatorExportController still names its parameter `boardId`, so the wire contract is unchanged; only the entity behind the id moved.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
		{ "key": "noAuthBase", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
		{ "key": "adminUser", "value": "admin" },
		{ "key": "adminPass", "value": "admin" },
		{ "key": "register", "value": "decidesk" },
		{ "key": "boardId", "value": "" }
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Seed governance body (the retargeted 'board')",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"pm.test('Setup: governance body created (201)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
							"const b = pm.response.json();",
							"const id = (b['@self'] && b['@self'].id) || b.id;",
							"pm.expect(id, 'governance body id captured').to.be.a('string');",
							"pm.collectionVariables.set('boardId', id);"
						]
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
					{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
					{ "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" }
				],
				"body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Newman Governance Reporting Body\",\n  \"bodyType\": \"supervisory-board\",\n  \"domain\": \"newman-governance-reporting\"\n}" },
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/decidiq/governance-body",
					"host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
					"path": [ "index.php", "apps", "openregister", "api", "objects", "decidiq", "governance-body" ]
				}
			}
		},
